==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[sjötíu]]'' meaning "[[seventy]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[einn]]'' "[[one]]". Meaning '''seventy and one'''.

===Numeral===
{{head|is|numeral|g=m}}

# '''[[seventy-one]]'''; the cardinal number after [[sjötíu#Icelandic|sjötíu]] and before [[sjötíu og tveir#Icelandic|sjötíu og tveir]].

